<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P assigns AA-plus rating to Airservices.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P assigns AA-plus rating to Airservices.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Thursday it assigned an AA-plus rating to the A$100 million 2001 Eurobond issue by the Australian government's Airservices Australia (ASA).</p>
</text>
